NOTE:
    - Here the ACFs are replaced by Space-Time Correlation functions where a node is compared to it's nearest neighbours over time.
    - CUDA version of the C_D, C_E, C_V, C_B (Displacement, Energy, Velocity)
    - Initial conditions are defined by using random displacements instead of random velocity

Build Instructions:

    From the "src" folder, run      : nvcc -x cu -std=c++20 -w --use_fast_math -O3 -arch=native main_v15_STCFs.cpp -o ../build/grph_v15_STCFs

    Note, fast-math can be used without introducing unwanted inaccuracies.

Run Instructions (example):
    From the "src" folder, run: ../build/grph_v15_STCFs -w 86 -h 86 -e 100 -s 41 -tt 500 -dt 0.01 -r 10
